                                                "sense_id": "8f76c34f-f6d4-3275-bb97-2052c1994dd1",
                                                "text": "Some became Christians, from whose faith and race, even at this day (for it is an hundred yeares since) few Portugalls assure themselves; although custome and length of time be much more forcible counsellors unto such mutations than any other compulsion."
